From: Olek Maraszek. To: Annelie Wibbeke. Subject: RE: RE: Helvetia box held at Waltershof

> annelie, box is at the zollstelle since 02:10, officer says doc mismatch, batch no on invoice ends 4471 and on the cert 4417. night shift cant fix it lol. do we ring helvetia?

From: Annelie Wibbeke. To: Olek Maraszek.

> Olek. Do not ring Helvetia. Ring Quality on-call first (Benedikta), she will decide, because it is a GDP consignment and the customer's rules about who speaks to whom are stricter than mine. I will have the corrected invoice by 07:30. In the future, please remember that the batch number is a number that someone typed, so check it against the label with your own eyes. The hold cost us 7 hours and I am billing Helvetia for the amendment at 45 EUR, not Korvane.

From: Olek Maraszek.

> ok boss. will print a bigger label for the dock lol

